    <section xml:id="sec-section-10-1">
      <title>Section 57 - Divergence and Curl</title>
      <objectives>
  <p><em>Learning Objectives</em></p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      Find the divergence of a vector field.
    </li>
    <li>
      Determine if a vector field is magnetic.
    </li>
    <li>
      Compute the curl of a vector field.
    </li>
    <li>
      Show that a vector field is not the curl of another vector field.
    </li>
  </ul>
</objectives>

